  "goodToKnow": "Der Grundriss is a floor plan: der Grundriss der Wohnung, ein offener Grundriss (open-plan). It's always included in German flat listings, with the room count, so a 3-Zimmer-Wohnung has two bedrooms and a living room. It can also mean an outline or compendium, used in book titles: Grundriss der Philosophie. Der Riss means crack or tear, and in old usage, technical drawing. Plural: die Grundrisse."
